From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:51:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: hwmon: apple,smc-hwmon: Allow
 #thermal-sensor-cells

The hwmon core registers a thermal zone for each temperature sensor
that a thermal-zones node points at, but the binding has no property
for the sensor index such a reference needs, #thermal-sensor-cells,
so that devicetree fails validation.

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml          | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml
index 64149ef4cc59..0377ae435609 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwmon/apple,smc-hwmon.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,12 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     const: apple,smc-hwmon
 
+  "#thermal-sensor-cells":
+    const: 1
+    description:
+      The cell is the index of a temperature sensor, counting the
+      temperature-* nodes in order from 0.
+
 patternProperties:
   "^current-[A-Za-z0-9]{4}$":
     $ref: "#/$defs/sensor"
